msgstr "Area salju menghabiskan energi Anda lebih cepat daripada area rumput."  #. Key:	PracticeMakesPerfect_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.PracticeMakesPerfect.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.PracticeMakesPerfect.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Continue honing your fishing skills to ensure a steady food supply for your adventures."
msgstr "Tingkatkan terus keterampilan memancing Anda untuk memastikan pasokan makanan yang stabil untuk petualangan Anda."  #. Key:	PracticeMakesPerfect_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.PracticeMakesPerfect.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.PracticeMakesPerfect.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Practice Makes Perfect"
msgstr "Latihan Membuat Kesempurnaan"  #. Key:	BasicsOfSurvival_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial1.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial1.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Your research journey demands resilience. First, you must master the fundamental skill of restoring your energy."
msgstr "Perjalanan riset Anda memerlukan ketahanan. Pertama, Anda harus menguasai keterampilan dasar untuk memulihkan energi Anda."  #. Key:	BasicsOfSurvival_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial1.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial1.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "The Basics of Survival"
msgstr "Dasar-dasar Bertahan Hidup"  #. Key:	ExploringTheUnknown_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial2.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial2.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Venture deeper inland. The wilderness holds many secrets, and perhaps some valuable resources."
msgstr "Pergilah lebih dalam ke pedalaman. Alam liar menyimpan banyak rahasia, dan mungkin beberapa sumber daya berharga."  #. Key:	ExploringTheUnknown_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial2.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial2.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Exploring the Unknown"
msgstr "Menjelajahi yang Tak Dikenal"  #. Key:	SettlingDown_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial3.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial3.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "It's time to establish a more permanent presence. Find a place to call your own!"
msgstr "Saatnya membangun kehadiran yang lebih permanen. Temukan tempat yang bisa kamu sebut milikmu!"  #. Key:	SettlingDown_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial3.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial3.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Settling Down"
msgstr "Menetap"  #. Key:	UplandHunting_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial4.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial4.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "The uplands are teeming with wildlife. Master the art of the hunt to gather valuable resources and protect yourself."
msgstr "Dataran tinggi dipenuhi margasatwa. Kuasai seni berburu untuk mengumpulkan sumber daya berharga dan melindungi diri Anda."  #. Key:	UplandHunting_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial4.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial4.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Upland Hunting"
msgstr "Berburu Dataran Tinggi"  #. Key:	UpgradeTime_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial5.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial5.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Your current shelter is temporary. It's time to invest in a more permanent and functional base of operations."
msgstr "Tempat berlindungmu saat ini hanya sementara. Saatnya berinvestasi pada markas operasi yang lebih permanen dan fungsional."  #. Key:	UpgradeTime_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial5.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial5.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Upgrade Time"
msgstr "Waktu Peningkatan"  #. Key:	Tutorial6_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial6.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial6.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Prepare for a challenging journey to the North Outpost, where valuable equipment awaits."
msgstr "Bersiaplah untuk perjalanan menantang ke Pos Utara, di mana perlengkapan berharga menanti."  #. Key:	Tutorial6_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial6.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial6.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "The North Outpost Expedition"
msgstr "Ekspedisi Pos Utara"  #. Key:	Tutorial7_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial7.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial7.Description_8_665031484F84F4453D05189416ACAD65 msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "It's time to bring modern conveniences to your home. Power up your cabin and expand your capabilities!"
msgstr "Saatnya menghadirkan kenyamanan modern ke rumahmu. Alirkan listrik ke pondokmu dan perluas kemampuanmu!"  #. Key:	Tutorial7_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial7.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial7.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B msgctxt "DT_AllQuests"
msgid "Electrifying Your Cabin"
msgstr "Mengaliri Listrik Ke Kabin Anda"  #. Key:	CatchFish10_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish10.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish10.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Use fishing reel to catch 10 fishes of any type"
msgstr "Gunakan alat pancing untuk menangkap 10 ikan apa saja"  #. Key:	CatchFish10_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish10.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish10.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Catch 10 Fish"
msgstr "Tangkap 10 Ikan"  #. Key:	CatchFish5_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish5.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish5.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Practice your fishing skills by catching 5 fish of any type"
msgstr "Latih kemampuan memancingmu dengan menangkap 5 ikan apa saja"  #. Key:	CatchFish5_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish5.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFish5.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Catch 5 Fish"
msgstr "Tangkap 5 Ikan"  #. Key:	CatchFishTutorial_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFishTutorial.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFishTutorial.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Catch fish using the Fishing Rod at designated Fishing Spots"
msgstr "Tangkap ikan menggunakan Alat Pancing di Tempat Memancing yang ditentukan"  #. Key:	CatchFishTutorial_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFishTutorial.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CatchFishTutorial.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Catch Your First Fish"
msgstr "Tangkap Ikan Pertamamu"  #. Key:	CollectMkFromStation_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CollectMkFromStation.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CollectMkFromStation.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Collect Mk currency from the Weather Station you've placed"
msgstr "Kumpulkan mata uang Mk dari Stasiun Cuaca yang telah Anda letakkan"  #. Key:	CollectMkFromStation_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CollectMkFromStation.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CollectMkFromStation.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Collect Mk from Weather Station"
msgstr "Kumpulkan Mk dari Stasiun Cuaca"  #. Key:	CookFishTutorial_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CookFishTutorial.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CookFishTutorial.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Cook the fish at a Campfire to restore your energy"
msgstr "Masak ikan ini di Api Unggun untuk memulihkan energi Anda"  #. Key:	CookFishTutorial_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CookFishTutorial.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.CookFishTutorial.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Cook Fish"
msgstr "Masak Ikan"  #. Key:	DeployPowerSource_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.DeployPowerSource.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.DeployPowerSource.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Prepare for the North Outpost expedition by deploying electrical devices to secure a power source"
msgstr "Bersiaplah untuk ekspedisi Pos Utara dengan memasang perangkat listrik untuk mengamankan sumber daya"  #. Key:	DeployPowerSource_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.DeployPowerSource.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.DeployPowerSource.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Place Down A Generator"
msgstr "Tempatkan Generator"  #. Key:	EquipFishingRod_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.EquipFishingRod.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.EquipFishingRod.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Equip the Fishing Rod from your Inventory"
msgstr "Pasang Alat Pancing dari Inventarismu"  #. Key:	EquipFishingRod_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.EquipFishingRod.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.EquipFishingRod.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Equip Fishing Rod"
msgstr "Pasang Alat Pancing"  #. Key:	ExchangeFeathersForBulbs_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.ExchangeFeathersForBulbs.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.ExchangeFeathersForBulbs.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Exchange Feathers for Light Bulbs"
msgstr "Tukarkan Bulu untuk Bohlam"  #. Key:	FindWeatherStation_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.FindWeatherStation.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.FindWeatherStation.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Find the Weather Station inside a Hidden Container at the North Outpost"
msgstr "Temukan Stasiun Cuaca dalam Kontainer Tersembunyi di Pos Luar Utara"  #. Key:	FindWeatherStation_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.FindWeatherStation.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.FindWeatherStation.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Loot Weather Station"
msgstr "Jarah Stasiun Cuaca"  #. Key:	GatherBerries5_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherBerries5.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherBerries5.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Gather 5 Berries from bushes in the wilderness"
msgstr "Kumpulkan 5 Buah dari semak-semak di padang belantara"  #. Key:	GatherBerries5_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherBerries5.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherBerries5.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Gather Berries"
msgstr "Kumpulkan Buah Berry"  #. Key:	GatherFlowers5_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherFlowers5.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherFlowers5.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Gather 5 Flowers. They can often be found in clearings"
msgstr "Kumpulkan 5 Bunga. Mereka sering ditemukan di tempat terbuka"  #. Key:	GatherFlowers5_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherFlowers5.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GatherFlowers5.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Gather Flowers"
msgstr "Kumpulkan Bunga"  #. Key:	GoToBaseCamp_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GoToBaseCamp.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GoToBaseCamp.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Venture deeper inland and locate Sgt. Lake's Base Camp"
msgstr "Melakukan perjalanan lebih dalam ke daratan dan temukan Perkemahan Sersan Lake"  #. Key:	GoToBaseCamp_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GoToBaseCamp.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.GoToBaseCamp.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Find Base Camp"
msgstr "Temukan Kamp Dasar"  #. Key:	HarvestWood20_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HarvestWood20.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HarvestWood20.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Your next project requires lumber. Use a Chainsaw to harvest 20 Wood"
msgstr "Proyek Anda berikutnya membutuhkan kayu. Gunakan Gergaji Mesin untuk memanen 20 Kayu"  #. Key:	HarvestWood20_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HarvestWood20.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HarvestWood20.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Harvest Wood"
msgstr "Tebang Kayu"  #. Key:	HuntBirds3_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntBirds3.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntBirds3.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Test your new weapon. Hunt 3 birds in the nearby forest"
msgstr "Uji senjata barumu. Berburu 3 burung di hutan sekitar"  #. Key:	HuntBirds3_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntBirds3.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntBirds3.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Hunt Birds"
msgstr "Berburu Burung"  #. Key:	ExchangeFeathersForBulbs_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntKiirunaBird.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntKiirunaBird.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Exchange Bird Feathers for Light Bulbs at a vendor"
msgstr "Tukarkan Bulu Burung untuk Bola Lampu di vendor"  #. Key:	36A3B67A47AB545087B4E9A348FFCA64 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntKiirunaBird.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.HuntKiirunaBird.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Hunt Kiiruna Bird"
msgstr "Buru Burung Kiiruna"  #. Key:	InstallSolarPanels_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.InstallSolarPanels.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.InstallSolarPanels.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Install the Solar Panels on your property to begin generating electricity"
msgstr "Pasang Panel Surya di properti Anda untuk mulai menghasilkan listrik"  #. Key:	InstallSolarPanels_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.InstallSolarPanels.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.InstallSolarPanels.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Install Solar Panels"
msgstr "Pasang Panel Surya"  #. Key:	LocateNorthOutpost_Description #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.LocateNorthOutpost.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.LocateNorthOutpost.Description_12_D8207A4B495263BEED9C6A9F794B18FF msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Head North and locate the North Outpost"
msgstr "Pergi ke Utara dan cari Pos Utara"  #. Key:	LocateNorthOutpost_TranslatedName #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.LocateNorthOutpost.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 #: /Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllTasks.DT_AllTasks.LocateNorthOutpost.TranslatedName_29_C60BF5914C9CF76161B4D29D35405374 msgctxt "DT_AllTasks"
msgid "Locate North Outpost"
