msgstr "VPN"  #. Key:	7B581A1A4DE95BA83A692098E1ABF208 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/PC_Longvinter.PC_Longvinter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_Longvinter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/PC_Longvinter.PC_Longvinter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_Longvinter [Script Bytecode] msgid "You have to wait before reporting the same player again!"
