msgstr "Tidak dapat mengambil saat ada orang di dalam"  #. Key:	24AC6C244F684DFB77306F923165B7DA #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/A_Placeable_Sign.A_Placeable_Sign_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_Sign [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/A_Placeable_Sign.A_Placeable_Sign_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_Sign [Script Bytecode] msgid "Peacocks strut and preen in vibrant gardens, their feathered tails a sight to be seen."
msgstr "Burung merak berdiri tegak dan bersolek di taman yang semarak, ekornya yang penuh bulu menjadi pemandangan yang menarik untuk dilihat."  #. Key:	3DCB74B5466FF93EE867CAA529576392 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/A_Placeable_Sign.A_Placeable_Sign_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_Sign [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/A_Placeable_Sign.A_Placeable_Sign_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_Sign [Script Bytecode] msgid "Amidst the northern forest, logs are sawn, in this place where trees meet their dawn."
msgstr "Di tengah hutan bagian utara, kayu-kayu digergaji, di tempat ini pohon-pohon bertemu dengan fajarnya."  #. Key:	6BBC2ED84FC69C3827EA5685DD0D3AE3 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/A_Placeable_Sign.A_Placeable_Sign_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_Sign [Script Bytecode] #. Key:	D4330E8A4F9A0C00E1A65CA6E17B84C8 #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/A_Placeable_Sign.A_Placeable_Sign_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_Sign [Script Bytecode] msgid "---"
