msgstr "Pagar bersama hanya bisa dikunci ketika kau tingkatkan tenda mu menjadi rumah dengan meja kerja"  #. Key:	669B939B44E26369BAC53B9ED5D54A27 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_HomeAccessGate.Placeable_HomeAccessGate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_HomeAccessGate [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_HomeAccessGate.Placeable_HomeAccessGate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_HomeAccessGate [Script Bytecode] msgid "This gate is locked! You need home access to unlock."
msgstr "Gerbang ini terkunci! Anda memerlukan akses rumah untuk membuka kunci."  #. Key:	F832418546A4F50F46C036952217AE43 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_HomeAccessGate.Placeable_HomeAccessGate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_HomeAccessGate [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_HomeAccessGate.Placeable_HomeAccessGate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_HomeAccessGate [Script Bytecode] msgid "This gate can be accessed by anyone, no house near it"
