msgstr "Alat saat ini tidak dapat menebang pohon ini"  #. Key:	012BE15F4A72C5C58B3D83815EFB775F #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_Workbench.Placeable_Workbench_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_Workbench [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_Workbench.Placeable_Workbench_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_Workbench [Script Bytecode] msgid "Workbench could not find home, place the workbench again."
msgstr "Meja kerja tidak dapat menemukan rumah, tempatkan meja kerja lagi."  #. Key:	257872E845F1E10FB9A2CFA0BA199F9C #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_Workbench.Placeable_Workbench_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_Workbench [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Placeable_Workbench.Placeable_Workbench_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Placeable_Workbench [Script Bytecode] msgid "Some vendors sell crafting book item that shows every craftable item in the game. There is also a cooking book!"
msgstr "Beberapa penjual menjual barang buku kerajinan yang menampilkan setiap barang yang dapat diolah di dalam game. Buku memasak juga ada!"  #. Key:	322A425B47A472718A82BDBC6D070ABB #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Quest/A_Placeable_QuestInteractionObject.A_Placeable_QuestInteractionObject_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_QuestInteractionObject [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Blueprints/Placeables/Quest/A_Placeable_QuestInteractionObject.A_Placeable_QuestInteractionObject_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_Placeable_QuestInteractionObject [Script Bytecode] msgid "You have already interacted with this"
