msgstr "Alatpenggunasaat ini"  #. Key:	060659D54FFAF93ECAAC488F199D1D6B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_MultiMenuTemplate [Script Bytecode] #. Key:	F2A4A9A947CDF374A4FD9694F86F97BA #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.Default__UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C.CategoryData.DisplayName_2_4246A1A94D73F501F4D982B0AB0C6F68 #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.Default__UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C.CategoryData.DisplayName_2_4246A1A94D73F501F4D982B0AB0C6F68 #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_MultiMenuTemplate [Script Bytecode] msgid "No Selection"
msgstr "Tdak ada pilihan"  #. Key:	8FE5681E42C59BCAFA0409B5D82D79A6 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_MultiMenuTemplate [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_MultiMenuTemplate [Script Bytecode] msgid "Go Back"
msgstr "Kembali"  #. Key:	0A632FAD42CD9503BF4F6092A5DC36D4 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:GetCategoryData [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:GetCategoryData [Script Bytecode] msgid "Unknown Category"
msgstr "Kategori tak diketahui"  #. Key:	2F702D9A4911632DDBF45FAE6CE7AA9B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:GetItemData [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:GetItemData [Script Bytecode] msgid "Unknown Item"
msgstr "Barang tidak diketahui"  #. Key:	57661CB1433C71E18C123CB157D46864 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:GetItemData [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:GetItemData [Script Bytecode] msgid "No Item"
msgstr "Tidak ada item"  #. Key:	EECDAE85497E690CC4B1B0B484ABF3FD #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:WidgetTree.MenuSubselection.Text #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:WidgetTree.MenuSubselection.Text msgid "ItemName"
msgstr "NamaItem"  #. Key:	5FE6983D44EFF54885EF0B8364B45C68 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_160.Text #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/Templates/UMG_MultiMenuTemplate.UMG_MultiMenuTemplate_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_160.Text msgid "To use this template, you can either edit the categories table and add your own, and add child tables to those, or replace the functionality in the \"Custom Data\" section to inject your own data. Be sure to make a duplicate of this blueprint and move your customized version outside of the PieMenus folder."
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan template ini, Anda dapat mengedit tabel kategori dan menambahkan tabel Anda sendiri, dan menambahkan tabel anak ke tabel tersebut, atau mengganti fungsionalitas di bagian \"Data Kustom\" untuk memasukkan data Anda sendiri. Pastikan untuk membuat duplikat dari cetak biru ini dan pindahkan versi kustomisasi Anda di luar folder PieMenus."  #. Key:	034555AF49FD94A26C001DAAB71D8E69 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EIconAnimationStyles.EIconAnimationStyles.DisplayNameMap(1 - Value).DisplayNameMap #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EIconAnimationStyles.EIconAnimationStyles.DisplayNameMap(1 - Value).DisplayNameMap msgid "Grow"
msgstr "Tumbuh"  #. Key:	55DBDA3045C0F91FEE423EAACD60046C #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EIconAnimationStyles.EIconAnimationStyles.DisplayNameMap(2 - Value).DisplayNameMap #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EIconAnimationStyles.EIconAnimationStyles.DisplayNameMap(2 - Value).DisplayNameMap msgid "Shake"
msgstr "Getar"  #. Key:	1C1369F24AFB41EE0A1A259B1C4BCD7D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EJoystickTypes.EJoystickTypes.DisplayNameMap(0 - Value).DisplayNameMap #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EJoystickTypes.EJoystickTypes.DisplayNameMap(0 - Value).DisplayNameMap msgid "LeftStick"
msgstr "LeftStick"  #. Key:	82A3E55C4D5AC8626272FE907DA6C5D6 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EJoystickTypes.EJoystickTypes.DisplayNameMap(1 - Value).DisplayNameMap #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/EJoystickTypes.EJoystickTypes.DisplayNameMap(1 - Value).DisplayNameMap msgid "RightStick"
msgstr "RightStick"  #. Key:	92C1BBF34AD40C22EA0A098A07B02B9B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/UMG_RadialMenu.UMG_RadialMenu_C:DebugIndex [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/GenericRadialMenus/UMG/UMG_RadialMenu.UMG_RadialMenu_C:DebugIndex [Script Bytecode] msgid "float index: {fi}\r\nint index   : {ii}"
msgstr "float index: {fi}\r\nint index   : {ii}"  #. Key:	1E22AA054EFE301CBC21B39A7044F482 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "If you just subscribed/downloaded new mods from steam the game needs to be restarted again for the mods to be loaded correctly.\r\n\r\nIf this keeps happening try unsubscribing from the mods in steam and deleting everything inside  \"\\steamapps\\common\\Longvinter\\Longvinter\\Mods\""
msgstr "Jika Anda baru saja berlangganan/mengunduh mod baru dari Steam, game perlu distart ulang lagi agar mod dapat dimuat dengan benar.\r\n\r\nJika hal ini terus terjadi, coba berhenti berlangganan dari mod di Steam dan hapus semua di dalam \"\\steamapps\\common\\Longvinter\\Longvinter\\Mods\"""  #. Key:	502148E3455670721D1E3F869E1015BE #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "Exit game"
msgstr "Keluar dari permainan"  #. Key:	535250184667106040D29BB8F4667121 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "The game will close after downloading the missing mods.\r\nYou can use the continue button to join the server after the restart."
msgstr "Permainan akan ditutup setelah mengunduh mod yang hilang.\\\r Anda dapat menggunakan tombol lanjutkan untuk bergabung dengan server setelah restart."  #. Key:	6F4BF35541D0705951919D809D701C85 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "Please note: Some official and some unofficial servers prohibit the use of VPNs or any IP-altering software. To ensure smooth connectivity:\r\n\r\n1. Disable your VPN before connecting.\r\n2. Choose a server that is VPN-friendly.\r\n3. If necessary, reach out to us for whitelisting options tailored to your needs."
msgstr "Harap diperhatikan: Beberapa server resmi dan beberapa server tidak resmi melarang penggunaan VPN atau perangkat lunak pengubah IP. Untuk memastikan konektivitas yang lancar:\r\n\r\n1. Nonaktifkan VPN Anda sebelum menyambung.\r\n2. Pilih server yang ramah VPN.\r\n3. Jika perlu, hubungi kami untuk opsi daftar putih yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan Anda."  #. Key:	72B6E1D84F66137518AE5691681696E0 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "Mods and restart required!"
msgstr "Mod dan restart diperlukan!"  #. Key:	90817381494BF76A28928FA4094E3EC4 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "Install and exit game"
msgstr "Pasang dan keluar dari game"  #. Key:	9E04F17449C93CD838E797A23EAF0B7D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "Mod Download"
msgstr "Unduh Mod"  #. Key:	A32CCA574CAE2DA334AD94B8F99F05AE #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "Mods Downloaded"
msgstr "Mod Diunduh"  #. Key:	B2599CED44B55B357C4DDCA8C415E516 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "Longvinter 2nd Anniversary"
msgstr "Ulang Tahun ke-2 Longvinter"  #. Key:	B4E6C9BB415287114E85B4A40E9CFD6A #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Maps/MainMenu/PC_MainMenu.PC_MainMenu_C:ExecuteUbergraph_PC_MainMenu [Script Bytecode] msgid "The game will close in 5s"
