msgstr "Tidak dapat meletakkan di atas batu!"  #. Key:	E576461F458C53AD85D59BB338533B6D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ItemPlacingComponent.ItemPlacingComponent_C:getOverlapResult [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ItemPlacingComponent.ItemPlacingComponent_C:getOverlapResult [Script Bytecode] msgid "You can only place 2 Stations near your house"
