msgstr "Penemuan baru!"  #. Key:	089EEE50419E78BA0F9260B2E694055D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "No map equipped!"
msgstr "Peta tidak digunakan!"  #. Key:	20FE833B47C7C94D2E21AE80C3E28183 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Can't use mount while combat status is active!"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menggunakan menunggang saat status pertempuran masih aktif!"  #. Key:	23F8657A45A48848B9B946B5F0E8D43C #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Can't change mount while mounted"
msgstr "Tidak dapat mengubah tunggangan saat digunakan"  #. Key:	30C3326C486DD80C27A1F58FA4A2FCF9 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Minimum drop amount is 10 mk"
msgstr "Minimal jumlah drop adalah 10 mk"  #. Key:	32E3899B4C1E6DEC41CD81AF9628136D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Boat motor not powered!"
msgstr "Mesin perahu tidak ada tenaga!"  #. Key:	345C4B7D421BA2B54BAF0E846A0ADBF8 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Metal parts and other important items can be found in chests around the map or purchased from Julia's mysterious shops randomly."
msgstr "Komponen logam dan benda penting lainnya dapat ditemukan dalam peti di sekitar peta atau dibeli dari toko misterius Julia secara acak."  #. Key:	357E205F4E6638DBBAADF2AA2D3CE6B9 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Not enough electricity!"
msgstr "Kekurangan Listrik!"  #. Key:	3ED51AAD4725DF2BBB2021869AD76CED #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Add at least 2 ore chunks to the smelter!"
msgstr "Tambahkan setidaknya 2 bongkahan bijih ke dalam smelter!"  #. Key:	434C806640ACE5417C8D9FAA218B34A9 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Your movement startled the fish & your fishing ability is on cooldown"
msgstr "Pergerakanmu mengejutkan ikan & kemampuan memancingmu dalam cooldown"  #. Key:	48E2DD134870EB0D3699E5AD16FEC82D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "You should try to complete your compendiums! Easiest compendium is the flower compendium!"
msgstr "Anda harus mencoba menyelesaikan kompendium Anda! kompendium yang paling mudah adalah bunga!"  #. Key:	4A6823ED45C6E8EF710A2590D58E4A81 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Out of reach"
msgstr "Diluar jangkauan"  #. Key:	4B703E2548B841A1D5D979BAA651CB58 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Turrets will kill you if you shoot with your weapon"
msgstr "Turet akan membunuh Anda jika Anda menembakkan senjata Anda"  #. Key:	4FE253B74ADC1200360FEC854086E94E #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "You are already fishing"
msgstr "Kamu sudah memancing"  #. Key:	51AAA6484922947A2EFF4B8FCBB71214 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Seeds for plants can be found from points of interests and bought from vendors."
msgstr "Benih tanaman bisa ditemukan di tempat-tempat penting dan bisa dibawa ke pedagang."  #. Key:	57F9FDD647A81C1050FE58A6818D4C35 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Other player left the trade"
msgstr "Pemain lain meninggalkan pertukaran"  #. Key:	5A4845B14C7626113A6CE88FFC764F6A #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "You can damage other players and vice versa"
msgstr "Anda dapat merusak pemain lain dan sebaliknya"  #. Key:	68972F5D4654B51582BF5B9AF789544E #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Not enough MK!"
msgstr "MK tidak cukup!"  #. Key:	6BA948184614EFB9EC1EC1A430D09222 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Mk drop is on cooldown!"
msgstr "Jatuhan Mk sedang cooldown!"  #. Key:	6FB3B1C942CDE47BB48AD4B667B32740 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "New status effect"
msgstr "Efek status baru"  #. Key:	706F0B0A466C5CF7E508E886BD9175F9 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "You cannot fish while swimming"
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat memancing sambil berenang"  #. Key:	733D498F49B0CEC9C30546A40F97EE23 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Invite sent"
msgstr "Undangan terkirim"  #. Key:	796408D74FA189ABB15636A76500C207 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Too far away to trade"
msgstr "Terlalu jauh untuk melakukan Pertukaran"  #. Key:	7C64BAEE45E70FA44F7DC1A1C5FFED6C #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "You need to supply a workbench in your house with wood to keep the house from decaying!"
msgstr "Anda perlu menyediakan meja kerja di rumah Anda dengan kayu agar rumah tidak hancur!"  #. Key:	864EBFAD4CCF55B4054F19BAD14D2CD8 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Can't teleport while in a boat"
