msgstr "Jual semua?"  #. Key:	88C2109348FB1CC0C103AD90D528B8B2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Add at least 2 coal chunks to the smelter!"
msgstr "Tambahkan setidaknya 2 bongkahan batu bara ke dalam smelter!"  #. Key:	8BCCDAF043D9B38CCDECC69D08F710D9 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Only you can enter a tent. You can share your home once you upgrade it to a wooden house and share the keycode with your friends."
msgstr "Hanya kamu yang bisa memasuki tenda. Kamu bisa berbagi rumahmu ketika kamu sudah meningkatkannya menjadi rumah kayu dan membagikan kode kunci dengan temanmu."  #. Key:	8E84A3E84FBE7BD8F480BEAC84FBD3AE #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Vintercoins will be rewarded at the end of the session!"
