msgstr "Anda membutuhkan alat pancing"  #. Key:	A7921AF64817C977364A5E81768B2B14 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Blueprints/ThirdPersonCharacter.ThirdPersonCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_ThirdPersonCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Cannot pickup while in water"
