msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan Gergaji Mesin saya untuk memotong kayu"  #. Key:	E6D36445407BE04558C84FADE9F620D6 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Pets/A_TutorialPetCharacter.A_TutorialPetCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_TutorialPetCharacter [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/ThirdPersonCPP/Pets/A_TutorialPetCharacter.A_TutorialPetCharacter_C:ExecuteUbergraph_A_TutorialPetCharacter [Script Bytecode] msgid "Now we just need to wait for the Mk to gather"
