msgstr "Mengubah gaya interior"  #. Key:	DED38C274EC8BF6A8420CC84541DD00D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] msgid "Electricity Generator"
msgstr "Generator Listrik"  #. Key:	DFE0D1AE447088A93EDC5C845A5A243A #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] msgid "Removes rocks from the drill yield, enabling longer mining sessions and improved outcomes."
msgstr "Menghilangkan bebatuan dari hasil pengeboran, memungkinkan sesi penambangan lebih lama dan hasil yang lebih baik."  #. Key:	F37C79EF487A5BDDEC24CF97561AEB43 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] msgid "Set turrets to passive!"
msgstr "Atur turret ke pasif!"  #. Key:	FCDCB4D74C9E6376230AE28353276177 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] msgid "Turrets"
msgstr "Menara"  #. Key:	FE5B564B460D3971FC2D0283B080E5F8 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] msgid "This will give you your tent and workbench back. All other items are destroyed so remove them before dismantle. You will lose your house upgrade and all the wood."
msgstr "Ini akan mengembalikan tenda dan meja kerja Anda. Semua item lainnya akan hancur, jadi singkirkan semua item tersebut sebelum membongkar. Anda akan kehilangan upgrade rumah dan semua kayu."  #. Key:	FFF0F0DB45EA073D4ECAFC94DCC706ED #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_HouseUpgrade.UMG_HouseUpgrade_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_HouseUpgrade [Script Bytecode] msgid "Transforms the windmill from generating electricity to grinding wheat into flour for baking."
