msgstr "ID SteamMu:"  #. Key:	A288038942FC077133F8E0B9C759719E #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.T_Title.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.T_Title.Text msgid "* Title"
msgstr "* Judul"  #. Key:	8AB69A7B450D09EEAA752896D88F32B5 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit.Text msgid "Submit issue to Uuvana"
msgstr "Kirim masalah ke Uuvana"  #. Key:	FCF2C75C4E2A094C26424990EC2E7E65 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit_1.Text msgid "Suggest a feature"
msgstr "Sarankan fitur"  #. Key:	938DE7E04411F71931DFF8B90F6E2C65 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit_2.Text msgid "Report a player"
msgstr "Laporkan pemain"  #. Key:	502EE2524CA4D6E949BFBA957FF62814 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text msgid "Report another issue"
msgstr "Laporkan masalah lain"  #. Key:	01A2D7E84728F22471B103952B2D357B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_1.Text msgid "Similar reports"
msgstr "Laporan serupa"  #. Key:	672776234CE109660303A1A56B12981E #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_151.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_151.Text msgid "Report an issue"
msgstr "Laporkan masalah"  #. Key:	1F71365B4B150E2FB34552B1F3054EA2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_2.Text msgid "Steps to reproduce"
msgstr "Langkah untuk mereproduksi"  #. Key:	2F526FF74F4109A6E6C28D9A44F16770 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_3.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_3.Text msgid "We found these reports that could be related to your issue. Please read them and report if any of them resemble your problem. This helps us organize issues!\r\n\r\n"
msgstr "Kami menemukan laporan-laporan ini yang mungkin terkait dengan masalah Anda. Silakan baca dan laporkan jika ada yang mirip dengan masalah Anda. Ini membantu kami untuk mengatur masalah!\r\n\r\n"  #. Key:	8311515E4B4E86A501F14FBF70ABA2EA #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_4.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_4.Text msgid "Our team will process the report promptly and work to resolve verified issues in a timely manner.\r\n\r\nWe appreciate your cooperation and patience as we strive to deliver the best possible experience."
msgstr "Tim kami akan memproses laporan dengan segera dan bekerja untuk menyelesaikan masalah yang terverifikasi secara tepat waktu.\r\n\r\nKami menghargai kerjasama dan kesabaran Anda saat kami berusaha memberikan pengalaman terbaik yang mungkin.""  #. Key:	DEFE845843B4AB0EF54A3F991BDFC7A2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_511.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_511.Text msgid "Please report any in-game, non-player behaviour-related issues using this form. Include detailed descriptions and, if applicable, a step-by-step guide to reproduce the issue.\r\n\r\nBy submitting a comprehensive report, you contribute to improving the game for everyone."
msgstr "Harap laporkan setiap masalah dalam game yang tidak terkait dengan perilaku pemain menggunakan formulir ini. Sertakan deskripsi terperinci dan, jika berlaku, panduan langkah-demi-langkah untuk mereproduksi masalah tersebut.\r\n\r\nDengan mengirimkan laporan yang komprehensif, Anda berkontribusi dalam meningkatkan kualitas game untuk semua orang.""  #. Key:	63331E624173013F9A98DD94AE4349B3 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_545.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_Feedbackform.UMG_Feedbackform_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_545.Text msgid "Report submitted:"
msgstr "Laporan terkirim:"  #. Key:	2BC0175F48AB061A52839BA6D19E899A #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_SimilarReport.UMG_SimilarReport_C:WidgetTree.T_Title_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_SimilarReport.UMG_SimilarReport_C:WidgetTree.T_Title_1.Text msgid " Title"
msgstr "Judul"  #. Key:	8651A6BB4BD9E8668165A48E818BD973 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_SimilarReport.UMG_SimilarReport_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Feedbackform/UMG_SimilarReport.UMG_SimilarReport_C:WidgetTree.Text_Submit.Text msgid "Report similar issue"
msgstr "Laporkan masalah serupa"  #. Key:	41EFEE8F4517CB2AC08DE58DC4028300 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Language/ENUM_Languages.Enum_Languages.DisplayNameMap(0 - Value).DisplayNameMap #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/Language/ENUM_Languages.Enum_Languages.DisplayNameMap(0 - Value).DisplayNameMap msgid "English"
