msgstr "Masukkan Sandi"  #. Key:	9DAAD3D04B4E5DA9DA375D816B742B32 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Password.UMG_Password_C:WidgetTree.TextPrivateServer.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Password.UMG_Password_C:WidgetTree.TextPrivateServer.Text msgid "Private Island"
msgstr "Pulau Pribadi"  #. Key:	42804DBC414EE9A52B9284BAE704B8F2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PlayerReport.UMG_PlayerReport_C:WidgetTree.T_expires_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PlayerReport.UMG_PlayerReport_C:WidgetTree.T_expires_1.Text msgid "Category:"
msgstr "Kategori:"  #. Key:	E93D08AA4AEEFBE4D5A874A03A099319 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PlayerReport.UMG_PlayerReport_C:WidgetTree.T_message.HintText #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PlayerReport.UMG_PlayerReport_C:WidgetTree.T_message.HintText msgid "Reason for report"
msgstr "Alasan laporan"  #. Key:	600C12D143FC40D1DD994A9328FA35EA #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PlayerReport.UMG_PlayerReport_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text #. Key:	8058AFC143101433533D668C080291F0 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/UMG_LMBDropdownMenu.UMG_LMBDropdownMenu_C:WidgetTree.T_CurrentTab_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PlayerReport.UMG_PlayerReport_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text #: /Game/Widgets/UMG_LMBDropdownMenu.UMG_LMBDropdownMenu_C:WidgetTree.T_CurrentTab_1.Text msgid "Report"
msgstr "Laporkan"  #. Key:	283FDDA34D46974DF13D2484A3DA04FD #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowDesc.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowDesc.Text msgid "3 Mar 2022"
msgstr "3 Mar 2022"  #. Key:	7A94979247F4E26D60304187F170936F #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowName.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowName.Text msgid "Official servers wiped 3/3"
msgstr "Server resmi dibersihkan 3/3"  #. Key:	EF171A8947478EB068557CAEFDB29124 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text msgid "We have wiped official servers on Thursday 3/3 due to issues with our save system. We might temporarily move to weekly or bi-weekly wipes on official servers, untill players have one tent limit and are able to pick their tents up, which we plan on doing soon. After that we can do wipes once a month. Tell us what you feel about this on our Discord!\r\n\r\nTeo\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n> What's going on with the saves?\r\n\r\nA couple days after launch we (and players) noticed that some things were not saving, player progress was lost sometimes upon logout, and most often on server restart, where player houses were also being wiped.\r\n\r\nThis is caused by the async saving / loading we're using. It would have worked perfectly if we had saved everything from homes, placeables and player progress to a single file, but we don't, we save on multiple files, and sometimes the async saving just won't save if there is already another process going on.\r\n\r\nWhy didn't we notice this before release? The system stops working when there are multiple players logging in and out. \r\n\r\nThe latest rollback was just a couple of hours ago which was caused by a failsafe we tried to add, which actually made things worse by not saving at all for a long period of time. We reverted the change now.\r\n\r\nThis whole saving/loading thing is quite embarrassing, and we're sorry for wasting your time. We've been working 16 hours a day trying to fix this, and we can fix it, it just takes a little more time. We're trying to get this working this week, and we'll work the whole weekend if that is what it takes.\r\n\r\nThanks for your patience! \r\n"
msgstr "Kami telah menghapus server resmi pada Kamis 3/3 karena masalah dengan sistem penyimpanan kami. Kami mungkin akan sementara beralih ke penghapusan mingguan atau dua mingguan di server resmi, sampai pemain memiliki batas satu tenda dan dapat mengambil tenda mereka, yang kami rencanakan akan segera dilakukan. Setelah itu kami dapat melakukan penghapusan sebulan sekali. Beritahu kami pendapat Anda tentang hal ini di Discord kami!\r\n\r\nTeo\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n> Apa yang terjadi dengan penyimpanan?\r\n\r\nBeberapa hari setelah peluncuran, kami (dan pemain) menyadari bahwa beberapa hal tidak tersimpan, progres pemain terkadang hilang saat logout, dan paling sering saat server dimulai ulang, di mana rumah pemain juga ikut terhapus.\r\n\r\nIni disebabkan oleh penyimpanan/pemuatan asinkron yang kami gunakan. Ini akan bekerja sempurna jika kami menyimpan semua hal dari rumah, benda yang dapat ditempatkan, dan progres pemain ke dalam satu file, tetapi kami tidak melakukan itu, kami menyimpan di beberapa file, dan terkadang penyimpanan asinkron tidak akan menyimpan jika sudah ada proses lain yang berjalan.\r\n\r\nMengapa kami tidak menyadari ini sebelum rilis? Sistem berhenti bekerja ketika ada banyak pemain yang masuk dan keluar.\r\n\r\nRollback terbaru baru terjadi beberapa jam yang lalu yang disebabkan oleh pengaman yang kami coba tambahkan, yang sebenarnya membuat segalanya lebih buruk dengan tidak menyimpan sama sekali untuk waktu yang lama. Kami telah mengembalikan perubahan tersebut sekarang.\r\n\r\nMasalah penyimpanan/pemuatan ini cukup memalukan, dan kami mohon maaf telah menyia-nyiakan waktu Anda. Kami telah bekerja 16 jam sehari mencoba memperbaiki ini, dan kami bisa memperbaikinya, hanya butuh sedikit lebih banyak waktu. Kami berusaha menyelesaikan masalah ini minggu ini, dan kami akan bekerja sepanjang akhir pekan jika itu yang diperlukan.\r\n\r\nTerima kasih atas kesabaran Anda!"  #. Key:	49E5C0504E7A205DAFE2F1855B1BA0E3 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QueueScreen [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QueueScreen [Script Bytecode] msgid "."
msgstr "."  #. Key:	BDACAF164C40D98BF1B0AE848167D9F0 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QueueScreen [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QueueScreen [Script Bytecode] msgid "Something went wrong. Trying to join manually!"
msgstr "Ada yang salah. Mencoba untuk bergabung secara manual!"  #. Key:	D27795AA40937B8EEEC9149C3D715CD6 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QueueScreen [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_QueueScreen [Script Bytecode] msgid ". Trying to join manually!"
msgstr "Mencoba untuk bergabung secara manual!"  #. Key:	1B91D4D4462EBD853831959621D7FDF1 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:WidgetTree.T_Message.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:WidgetTree.T_Message.Text msgid "Your place in the queue"
msgstr "Posisi Anda dalam antrian"  #. Key:	FE5B67C046955F8175EAC3B80580C298 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:WidgetTree.T_Title.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:WidgetTree.T_Title.Text msgid "You are in queue"
msgstr "Anda sedang dalam antrian"  #. Key:	70E488C04F8CC35B7E8275932CD49B4A #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QueueScreen.UMG_QueueScreen_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_1.Text msgid "Leave Queue"
msgstr "Tinggalkan Antrian"  #. Key:	00A5017F4A87D5A88E7673B5490C3617 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:MakeUnavailable [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:MakeUnavailable [Script Bytecode] msgid "Not available"
msgstr "Tidak tersedia"  #. Key:	30E084C546E104DC2B5A6DB4285551C1 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:MakeUnavailable [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:MakeUnavailable [Script Bytecode] msgid "Not available in your region"
msgstr "Tidak tersedia di wilayah Anda"  #. Key:	76236F594F4B13C57516F991AB80882B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.connectToLatestText.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.connectToLatestText.Text msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Lewati"  #. Key:	6A0F60704F0721D82A2EC5881FBC7722 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.connectToLatestText_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.connectToLatestText_1.Text msgid "Start your own server"
msgstr "Mulai server anda sendiri"  #. Key:	EDC406BB4D977EEB65FC44AFC4A442AC #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pve_text.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pve_text.Text msgid "PVE"
msgstr "PVE"  #. Key:	B20F608B4B3B156BED025E85A72E7458 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pveBlock.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pveBlock.Text msgid "Cozy adventure with community"
msgstr "Petualangan yang nyaman bersama komunitas"  #. Key:	C2A33A86444C12508106BE8EA7214DAB #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pvpSmallText.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pvpSmallText.Text msgid "For those who want a challenge"
msgstr "Bagi kamu yang menginginkan tantangan"  #. Key:	4D2ADCA44554DB54E471FBA8CF3D4261 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pvpSmallText_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.pvpSmallText_2.Text msgid "Would you like to play tutorial first?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda ingin memainkan tutorial terlebih dahulu?"  #. Key:	D6C3467A418C7220292CE9AB9BB4D3F2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.PVPText_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.PVPText_1.Text msgid "Play Tutorial"
msgstr "Mainkan Tutorial"  #. Key:	AFDA34C849BF9F2A73B762B52429D5B8 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text msgid "Welcome to Longvinter!"
msgstr "Selamat datang di Longvinter!"  #. Key:	970CF8F8430CFD5BA3977188B65CFED5 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_141.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_141.Text msgid "No servers in history"
msgstr "Tidak ada server dalam riwayat"  #. Key:	1EBC1F634DE65DF59CA4679908353EA4 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_QuickJoin.UMG_QuickJoin_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_2.Text msgid "OR"
msgstr "ATAU"  #. Key:	72D664104312AE61751CABA604F0171C #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ReportPlayerContent.UMG_ReportPlayerContent_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_61.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ReportPlayerContent.UMG_ReportPlayerContent_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_61.Text msgid "Name (SteamID)"
msgstr "Nama (SteamID)"  #. Key:	DC81B99441442CCD46505DAC2CE2C93D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ReportPlayerList.UMG_ReportPlayerList_C:WidgetTree.SearchBox.HintText #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ReportPlayerList.UMG_ReportPlayerList_C:WidgetTree.SearchBox.HintText msgid "Search by name..."
msgstr "Cari berdasarkan nama..."  #. Key:	088D76054F48C427F26479BB4A99CA42 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ReportPlayerList.UMG_ReportPlayerList_C:WidgetTree.T_Title_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ReportPlayerList.UMG_ReportPlayerList_C:WidgetTree.T_Title_2.Text msgid "You can report players by clicking them or clicking \"report\" on the respawn screen"
msgstr "Kamu bisa melaporkan pemain dengan klik nama mereka atau klik \"laporkan\" pada layar yang muncul kembali"  #. Key:	B728DF194D233AB16097DFBF350F4BA6 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox.Text msgid "We want to ensure that Longvinter provides a good environment that is both healthy and positive for all players, as it should. To accomplish this, we would like to implement these in-game regulations. The following content includes some of the actions and behaviours that will result in your being banned from Longvinter."
msgstr "Kami ingin memastikan bahwa Longvinter menyediakan lingkungan yang baik, sehat, dan positif bagi semua pemain, sebagaimana mestinya. Untuk mencapai hal ini, kami ingin menerapkan peraturan dalam game ini. Konten berikut ini mencakup beberapa tindakan dan perilaku yang akan mengakibatkan Anda diblokir dari Longvinter."  #. Key:	126FDD8748559024FE77EAA3B346CF62 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_1.Text msgid "Joining Modded Servers"
msgstr "Bergabung dengan Modded Servers"  #. Key:	846C7AFD4BF8AEF984B493AFDD12A3DB #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_10.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_10.Text msgid "Penalties and Bans"
msgstr "Hukuman dan Larangan"  #. Key:	020CB669479DBC71AB7E9FA80DF1D194 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_11.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_11.Text msgid "The duration of penalties will be applied based on the severity of the offence. More serious offences will result in a longer suspension and it also depends on your behaviour history."
msgstr "Durasi hukuman akan diterapkan berdasarkan beratnya pelanggaran. Pelanggaran yang lebih serius akan mengakibatkan suspensi yang lebih lama dan juga bergantung pada riwayat perilaku Anda."  #. Key:	4F6E50864BA076D6B4E62EBE93C685BF #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_12.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_12.Text msgid "Ban Evading"
msgstr "Menghindari Ban"  #. Key:	4A6C768B40500E05FC62E99CC7F6D536 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_13.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_13.Text msgid "Creating a new account or using a different account to return to play does not absolve you of your previous actions. By doing so, we will ban your account for the same amount of time as the previous ban."
msgstr "Membuat akun baru atau menggunakan akun yang berbeda untuk kembali bermain tidak membebaskan Anda dari tindakan sebelumnya. Dengan demikian, kami akan memblokir akun Anda untuk jangka waktu yang sama dengan pemblokiran sebelumnya."  #. Key:	5364E6134D1A181EA3FE15A091E6B4B3 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_14.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_14.Text msgid "At any time, Uuvana Studios holds the right to modify these rules. It will be assumed that you have accepted the amended rules if you continue to play the game. Please discontinue playing the game if you do not accept the new rules in full or in part."
msgstr "Setiap saat, Uuvana Studios memiliki hak untuk mengubah peraturan ini. Anda akan diasumsikan telah menerima peraturan yang telah diubah jika Anda terus bermain game. Harap hentikan permainan jika Anda tidak menerima peraturan baru secara penuh atau sebagian."  #. Key:	152A387B41373942D9074EA0167D7AC2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_15.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_15.Text msgid "Bad Conduct"
msgstr "Perilaku buruk"  #. Key:	D070C5894EC8887A12BA9BB9E8E7A03B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_16.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_16.Text msgid "As a user of Longvinter's platform, you acknowledge and agree that we are not responsible for, nor do we have any control over, the content, functionality, or legality of modifications (\"Mods\") or their dedicated servers (\"Modded Servers\"). All Mods and Modded Servers are created and managed by third parties. Therefore, any interaction with Mods and Modded Servers, including the content you access, is solely at your own risk and discretion. Uuvana Studios does not oversee or moderate any Modded Servers or content therein.\r\n\r\nMoreover, we provide no guarantees regarding the availability or performance of Mods or Modded Servers, and we shall not be held liable for any harm or damages arising from their use. By using any Mods or interacting with Modded Servers, you relieve Uuvana Studios of all liability related to such use."
msgstr "Sebagai pengguna platform Longvinter, Anda mengakui dan menyetujui bahwa kami tidak bertanggung jawab atas, atau tidak memiliki kendali apa pun atas, konten, fungsionalitas, atau legalitas modifikasi (\"Mod\") atau server khusus mereka (\"Server Dimodifikasi\"). Semua Mod dan Server Dimodifikasi dibuat dan dikelola oleh pihak ketiga. Oleh karena itu, setiap interaksi dengan Mod dan Server Dimodifikasi, termasuk konten yang Anda akses, sepenuhnya merupakan risiko dan kebijaksanaan Anda sendiri. Uuvana Studios tidak mengawasi atau memoderasi Server Dimodifikasi atau konten di dalamnya.\r\n\r\nSelain itu, kami tidak memberikan jaminan apa pun terkait ketersediaan atau kinerja Mod atau Server Dimodifikasi, dan kami tidak akan bertanggung jawab atas kerugian atau kerusakan yang timbul dari penggunaan mereka. Dengan menggunakan Mod atau berinteraksi dengan Server Dimodifikasi, Anda membebaskan Uuvana Studios dari semua tanggung jawab terkait penggunaan tersebut.""  #. Key:	7D1A726E41E634D3AABEDEB3902FE9A0 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_17.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_17.Text msgid "*Unofficial servers might have their own regulations/rules and we are not responsible if you are banned from those servers."
msgstr "*Server tidak resmi mungkin memiliki peraturan/regulasi sendiri dan kami tidak bertanggung jawab jika Anda dilarang dari server tersebut."  #. Key:	4D3D6BAA4C832918BBD812BC37A42F2F #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_18.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_18.Text msgid "User Information Storage and Deletion Policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan Penyimpanan dan Penghapusan Informasi Pengguna"  #. Key:	9204439741C6E7AE2F4A9AABCA897266 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_19.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_19.Text msgid "At Uuvana Studios, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. We collect and store certain information about our users for the purpose of enhancing user experience and maintaining the integrity of our platform. This information includes: MAC address, Steam ID, reports made by the user, reports made about the user, user actions within the game, and IP address. Please note that IP addresses are stored temporarily and are automatically deleted after 30 days.\r\n\r\nWe understand the importance of data control and thus, provide our users with the option to request the deletion of their personal data. If you wish to exercise this right, please send us an email at contact@uuvana.com with your request. Upon receiving such a request, we will proceed with the deletion of your data in accordance with applicable laws and regulations, barring any legal requirements that might necessitate the retention of certain data."
msgstr "Di Uuvana Studios, kami menghargai privasi Anda dan berkomitmen untuk melindungi data pribadi Anda. Kami mengumpulkan dan menyimpan informasi tertentu tentang pengguna kami dengan tujuan untuk meningkatkan pengalaman pengguna dan menjaga integritas platform kami. Informasi ini meliputi: Alamat MAC, ID Steam, laporan yang dibuat oleh pengguna, laporan yang dibuat tentang pengguna, tindakan pengguna dalam game, dan alamat IP. Harap diperhatikan bahwa alamat IP disimpan sementara dan secara otomatis dihapus setelah 30 hari.\r\n\r\nKami memahami pentingnya kontrol data dan oleh karena itu, kami memberikan opsi kepada pengguna kami untuk meminta penghapusan data pribadi mereka. Jika Anda ingin menggunakan hak ini, silakan kirimkan email kepada kami di contact@uuvana.com dengan permintaan Anda. Setelah menerima permintaan tersebut, kami akan melanjutkan penghapusan data Anda sesuai dengan hukum dan peraturan yang berlaku, kecuali jika ada persyaratan hukum yang mengharuskan penyimpanan data tertentu."  #. Key:	0436B0234DFDED64B3A5398B64B83368 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_2.Text msgid "If you engage in disruptive, abusive, or discriminatory behaviours, you will be punished according to the severity of your actions. The following are a few examples of things you should avoid:"
msgstr "Jika Anda terlibat dalam perilaku mengganggu, kasar, atau diskriminatif, Anda akan dihukum sesuai dengan seberapa parah tindakan Anda. Berikut ini adalah beberapa contoh hal-hal yang harus Anda hindari:"  #. Key:	4121EEDD4F36403E7C53819EB76C2505 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_3.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_3.Text msgid "- Offensive language, insulting, harassing, or threatening\r\n- Discrimination or hate speech that is based on, including but not limited to, sexual orientation, gender identity, race, religion, and ethnicity.\r\n- Inappropriate game names, such as lewd, derogatory, or insulting.\r\n- Impersonation of any individual, business, or entity for malicious purposes"
msgstr "- Bahasa yang menyinggung, menghina, melecehkan, atau mengancam\r\n- Diskriminasi atau ujaran kebencian yang didasarkan pada, termasuk namun tidak terbatas pada, orientasi seksual, identitas gender, ras, agama, dan etnisitas.\r\n- Nama Pemain yang tidak pantas, seperti cabul, atau menghina.\r\n- Peniruan terhadap individu, bisnis, atau entitas apa pun untuk tujuan jahat"  #. Key:	65F1CF9F45C7DB69CA50538DA0DC233B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_358.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_358.Text msgid "Longvinter’s In-game Regulations"
msgstr "Peraturan Dalam Game Longvinter"  #. Key:	81810C85440AC6BCE04BB0A07BADE707 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_4.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_4.Text msgid "Cheating / Exploits"
msgstr "Kecurangan / Eksploitasi"  #. Key:	79C8D33A4302FF58A3974B9DF4645363 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_5.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_5.Text msgid "It is unacceptable to use or intentionally play with players who use cheats, hacks, exploits, or bugs to gain an unfair advantage over other players, ruining their gaming experience. If you find an exploit you should report it to our GitHub. Exploits used in player versus player gameplay will result in a 1 - 14 day ban. Using 3rd party cheats or exploits to duplicate items will result in a permanent ban."
msgstr "Tidak dapat diterima untuk menggunakan atau dengan sengaja bermain dengan pemain yang menggunakan cheat, peretasan, eksploitasi, atau bug untuk mendapatkan keuntungan yang tidak adil dari pemain lain, sehingga merusak pengalaman bermain mereka. Jika Anda menemukan eksploitasi, Anda harus melaporkannya ke GitHub kami. Eksploitasi yang digunakan dalam permainan pemain versus pemain akan mengakibatkan pemblokiran selama 1 - 14 hari. Menggunakan cheat atau eksploitasi pihak ketiga untuk menduplikasi item akan mengakibatkan ban permanen."  #. Key:	9BA4B20C4E29C9DBB19104890A900AB1 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_6.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_6.Text msgid "Griefing"
msgstr "Duka cita"  #. Key:	778BEBE041CDECD2FD2AE89119CDC685 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_7.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_7.Text msgid "We don't allow players to disrupt the normal flow of the game or otherwise act in a manner that is likely to negatively affect other players' ability to compete fairly when playing the game or their gaming experience (also known as \"griefing\"). Spawn camping, for example. Each case will be investigated and given a penalty."
msgstr "Kami tidak mengizinkan pemain untuk mengganggu alur normal permainan atau bertindak dengan cara yang dapat berdampak negatif terhadap kemampuan pemain lain untuk bersaing secara adil saat bermain game atau pengalaman bermain game mereka (juga dikenal sebagai \"berduka\"). Berkemah di tempat pemijahan, misalnya. Setiap kasus akan diselidiki dan diberi hukuman."  #. Key:	CB4A690040BD35671D35888ACDEA9A70 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_8.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_8.Text msgid "Real Money Trading"
msgstr "Perdagangan Uang Asli"  #. Key:	0537AEEC4B24D0143C611987C76D056E #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_9.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.MultiLineEditableTextBox_9.Text msgid "You may not use the game for any service or commercial gain, including, but not limited to, gathering in-game currency, items, or resources for profit."
msgstr "Anda tidak diperbolehkan untuk menggunakan game ini sebagai layanan atau keuntungan komersial apa pun, termasuk, namun tidak terbatas pada, mengumpulkan mata uang, barang, atau sumber daya dalam game untuk mendapatkan keuntungan."  #. Key:	925F37174686DEBE0F042EBE68FF8E12 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text msgid "Rules website"
msgstr "Peraturan Situs web"  #. Key:	1663656A4BE261EFA2ADC48DC0A487CA #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_Rules.UMG_Rules_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_1.Text msgid "I have read and agree to the rules"
msgstr "Saya telah membaca dan menyetujui peraturan"  #. Key:	07DF4EBD4DD84C14A67912B449957162 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] msgid "History"
msgstr "Riwayat"  #. Key:	48A419984A9A0088FE257D9D84AE66F2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] msgid "Your EOS ID"
msgstr "EOS ID Anda"  #. Key:	68B790E848F08A9BB0CFDFAD452F7B4D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] msgid "Searching..."
msgstr "Mencari..."  #. Key:	90CD75EF4F0A4D73A80DBD81D9B5901B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] msgid "Failure, no servers found."
msgstr "Gagal, server tidak ditemukan."  #. Key:	2C8BAE194A9F8E5B896045A0E13FFC71 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowName.Text #. Key:	BC5ED0E747AA3EC0BB2607A2B5A7AA80 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_ServerBrowser [Script Bytecode] #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowName.Text msgid "Browse Islands"
msgstr "Jelajahi Pulau-Pulau"  #. Key:	E998311B4360D1D40655499DB1B7EEB1 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text.Text msgid "Connect by IP"
msgstr "Terhubung melalui IP"  #. Key:	0E44C4DE41920A352589D29C1EB8B60F #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text_1.Text msgid "Server Providers"
msgstr "Penyedia Layanan"  #. Key:	A0BD17344B67A3A5BFE992BE3DA89DD9 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text_2.Text msgid "Find Servers"
msgstr "Temukan Server"  #. Key:	C761A6FE440580E5DD0C5FAE7B0FA014 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text_4.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.add_fuel_text_4.Text msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Segarkan"  #. Key:	E93F438043F348CC792359A3579E72EB #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_Admins.HintText #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_Admins.HintText msgid "Admin EOS IDs"
msgstr "ID Admin EOS"  #. Key:	803EB64348438DA2CFC627808B4B7F94 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_Community.HintText #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_Community.HintText msgid "Community link"
msgstr "Tautan komunitas"  #. Key:	F287D9DA446BB8177AE79C9AF49F465F #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_Password.HintText #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_Password.HintText msgid "Password"
msgstr "Kata Sandi"  #. Key:	74F1BF6C49B470C60B56B4A184AFDCB2 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_ServerName.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_ServerName.Text msgid "Session Name"
msgstr "Nama Sesi"  #. Key:	D2273C5A445B89B68336D7A772894806 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.SearchBox_1.HintText #. Key:	FFD430E0436D61450C2803871D9ACEEF #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_ServerTag.HintText #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_ServerTag.HintText #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.SearchBox_1.HintText msgid "Tag"
msgstr "Menandai"  #. Key:	7D5EED074C13802A15716C8EA12D330C #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID.Text msgid "Your EOS ID: -"
msgstr "ID EOS Anda: "  #. Key:	E04E36C54141D1FCF474779AE316F269 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID_1.Text msgid "Turning decay off will disable it for both tents and houses"
msgstr "Mematikan peleburan akan menonaktifkannya untuk tenda dan rumah"  #. Key:	643795794C2C32B379C9B89F15BAC560 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID_2.Text msgid "You will need to open port 7777 from your router so that other players can join"
msgstr "Anda perlu membuka port 7777 dari router Anda agar pemain lain dapat bergabung"  #. Key:	8F6E47844525CA1CCF3AE78BFABBDA0E #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID_3.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.ET_YourEOSID_3.Text msgid "All players will spawn here"
msgstr "Semua pemain akan muncul di sini"  #. Key:	3124D8084B2BD7A54E0DFD8BD2F70A13 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2.Text msgid "Current players"
msgstr "Pemain saat ini"  #. Key:	25805ACF45297C7880752CA30E8ED550 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_1.Text msgid "|"
msgstr "|"  #. Key:	34D1E27D4667B432D5ECFCA7D177674D #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_10.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_10.Text msgid "Wandering Traders"
msgstr "Pedagang Keliling"  #. Key:	92C684D34B68DCC5ABC399976945D966 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_2.Text msgid "Ping"
msgstr "Ping"  #. Key:	17E8A3F847C9E35A69C96982E2EA585B #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_3.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_3.Text msgid "Show full"
msgstr "Tampilkan penuh"  #. Key:	C9A0A40F4372AF0E99BFC9BA89A86DC1 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_4.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_4.Text msgid "Show empty"
msgstr "Tampilkan kosong"  #. Key:	9D95BEB5473697D8DAB41AA7C2148F23 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_8.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_8.Text msgid "Public"
msgstr "Publik"  #. Key:	1E03815041DFC04F214EF2B1773FF423 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_9.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Desc2_9.Text msgid "Co-op"
msgstr "Co-op"  #. Key:	27A82CCC49BF6F21C68C09AA62245460 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Modded.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Modded.Text msgid "Modded"
msgstr "Modded"  #. Key:	2FF00B81449A2599D33E7CA804E22677 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Official.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Official.Text msgid "Official"
msgstr "Resmi"  #. Key:	4A23129149831547FDF5C2AD8E32B2B0 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price.Text msgid "12.75£"
msgstr "12.75£"  #. Key:	20125D7A4FEC661D16EA078FDF93D8B8 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price_1.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price_1.Text msgid "4.75£"
msgstr "4.75£"  #. Key:	FFDC08774BF2FDBC1B9CD6910B5BFB34 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price_2.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price_2.Text msgid "28.75£"
msgstr "28.75£"  #. Key:	C3C61A0A4F0337D7E28D3D863E197713 #. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price_3.Text #: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_ServerBrowser.UMG_ServerBrowser_C:WidgetTree.T_Price_3.Text msgid "4.99€"
